    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>Your people are among the oldest explorers to chart the stars, and you benefit from eons of collected knowledge about space travel.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Duros\" title=\"Duros\">Duros</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> checks made to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Astrogate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Astrogate\">Astrogate</a> aboard a Starship.</p>",
